<p>Lay a trap that releases a radius 3 cloud of thick poisonous gas lasting 4 turns.</p><p>Each turn, the cloud poisons all within (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">166, 198, 222, 242, 260</acronym> nature damage over 5 turns).   There is a 25% chance the poison is enhanced with crippling, numbing or insidious effects.</p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>